{
  "title": "Compliance Dashboard",
  "uid": "hw-compliance",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "tags": ["health-watchers", "compliance", "hipaa"],
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Auth Failures Over Time (401 / 403)",
      "description": "Same query pattern as the Security dashboard's auth-failure panel.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"health-watchers-api\",status=\"401\"}[5m])) by (path)",
          "legendFormat": "401 {{ path }}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"health-watchers-api\",status=\"403\"}[5m])) by (path)",
          "legendFormat": "403 {{ path }}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Auth Failure Rate (401)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"health-watchers-api\",status=\"401\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "401/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Forbidden Rate (403)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 18, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"health-watchers-api\",status=\"403\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "403/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.05 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "MongoDB Backup Freshness",
      "description": "Time since the last successful MongoDB backup. Thresholds flag staleness that could indicate a compliance/data-retention risk.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "time() - mongodb_backup_last_timestamp_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "Time Since Last Backup"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 86400 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 172800 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "MongoDB Backup Age Over Time",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 8, "w": 24, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "time() - mongodb_backup_last_timestamp_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "Backup Age"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 86400 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 172800 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "HIPAA Audit Log Reference",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 16, "w": 24, "h": 5 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Detailed HIPAA audit-log analysis (who accessed what PHI) lives in Kibana, not here.**\n\nSee the **\"Health Watchers - HIPAA Audit Logs\"** dashboard, defined in `logging/kibana/dashboards-export.ndjson`, for per-user PHI access audit trails. This Grafana dashboard intentionally does not duplicate that view — it covers auth-failure rate and backup freshness as Prometheus-metric compliance signals only."
      }
    }
  ]
}
